+		 * bytes_xfered if that fails. For MMC cards accept
+		 * bytes_xfered. Then try to reset. If reset fails then
+		 * error out the remaining request, otherwise retry
+		 * once (N.B mmc_blk_reset() will not succeed twice in a
+		 * row).
